Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n2,"identify need for new client") -> branch(b2,AND) -> action(n4,"analyze market") -> converge(c1) -> action(n5,"send offer to potential client") -> action(n6,"inform management about responses") -> action(n7,"analyze responses") -> action(n8,"negotiate with client") -> action(n9,"detail offer according to preferences and receive response") -> action(n10,"is the response positive?") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n11,"prepare contract for signing") -> action(n13,"sign contract") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n2,"identify need for new client") -> branch(b2,AND) -> action(n4,"analyze market") -> converge(c1) -> action(n5,"send offer to potential client") -> action(n6,"inform management about responses") -> action(n7,"analyze responses") -> action(n8,"negotiate with client") -> action(n9,"detail offer according to preferences and receive response") -> action(n10,"is the response positive?") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n12,"analyze reasons for rejection and learn from experience") -> end(e1)